{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"herby-crude-rat","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\n`docs/architecture.md` describes RP-04 as unimplemented, and `docs/reuse-surface.md` says its diagnostic shadow will be removed in S7. RP-04 is closed. `REBAR_OPERATION_SNAPSHOT_SHADOW` remains enabled by default and diagnostic only for legacy shadow surfaces. Ticket vibrant-legal-hind, ADR 0098, and ticket opal-daffy-mutt establish this qualified current state.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Describe the implemented `OperationSnapshot` composer and runtime bindings.\n- Describe provider authentication carriers and the configuration ownership gate.\n- Identify the remaining diagnostic-only shadow boundary.\n- Avoid claiming that the snapshot controls every operation.\n- Remove migration-pending wording that RP-04 completion superseded.\n- Preserve ADR 0098 as a historical decision record and leave runtime behavior unchanged.\n- Run documentation links, reuse-surface contracts, and focused operation-snapshot tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Architecture documentation identifies RP-04 as implemented.\n- [ ] The documented current boundary includes composition, runtime binding, authentication carriers, and ownership enforcement.\n- [ ] The remaining diagnostic shadow is described as diagnostic only and enabled by default.\n- [ ] The documentation does not claim universal operation control.\n- [ ] ADR 0098 and runtime behavior remain unchanged.\n- [ ] Focused documentation and operation-snapshot checks pass.","id":"d6ad-764d-51e6-4e9b","parent_id":"b8bf-a5aa-2f4d-44d4","priority":1,"tags":["documentation","accuracy","f30a"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"F30A document the implemented RP-04 boundary"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787511358553764001,"uuid":"4e0b99b6-b311-43c7-b0f4-2013c09ce51b"}